.nh
.TH podman-machine-os 1
.SH "نام (NAME)"
podman-machine-os \- Manage a Podman virtual machine's OS

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBpodman machine os\fP \fIsubcommand\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\fBpodman machine os\fR is a set of subcommands that manage a Podman virtual machine's operating system.

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TS
allbox;
l l l 
l l l .
\fBCommand\fP	\fBMan Page\fP	\fBDescription\fP
apply	podman-machine-os-apply(1)	T{
Apply an OCI image to a Podman Machine's OS
T}
upgrade	podman-machine-os-upgrade(1)	Upgrade a Podman Machine's OS
.TE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBpodman(1)\fP, \fBpodman-machine(1)\fP, \fBpodman-machine-os-apply(1)\fP, \fBpodman-machine-os-upgrade(1)\fP

